      "cooked": "<p>With the popularity of SotM, couldn't they contact an existing publisher and private label their services? They could retain the creative control of the story/lore, and pretty much just use the publisher's resources for artists and distribution. I'm sure everything is just a business deal, but they could probably swing it such that the final product looks exactly like the covers from the game manuals, with the Sentinel Comics logo and everything.</p><p>I don't know what&nbsp;a good circulation number is for a comic book because I'm not in the comic book industry, but&nbsp;this seems like something one of the existing publishers would be interested in.</p><p>I wonder how many of us would pay for an on-line only comic based on SotM?</p>",
